whatsie (6.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * More apps from Ktechpit: two app cards in About, replacing the More
    Applications button, and an optional link on the lock screen.
  * Ukrainian interface translation, with a Ukrainian spell-check dictionary
    in the snap.
  * A Quit action in the launcher entry, for trays without menus (#402).
  * Fix a hang when the graphics stack floods its error output (#387).
  * Keep the chosen WhatsApp theme across restarts (#389).
  * Size the monochrome tray icon correctly on HiDPI displays (#396).

 -- Keshav Bhatt <keshavnrj@gmail.com>  Tue, 10 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0530

whatsie (6.1.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Theme: follow the desktop light/dark preference reliably on Linux via the
    portal, including across suspend/resume.
  * Reconnect on its own after resume instead of staying on the offline page.
  * Spell check: list every bundled dictionary in Settings.
  * Open WhatsApp channel links and text-only send links.

